{
  "$comment": "Render-gate scene manifest. See docs/guides/developer/RENDER_GATE.md. Stores under datasets/gate/ come from scripts/render-gate/generate_gate_scenes.py. Every exact case runs on each backend x device-scale-factor x projection listed; a case's 'viewport'/'dsf' override the defaults.",
